calibration/ab_risk_gate_divergence.jsonl

# Expanded HSCI universe deep OHLCV store (R2-only, ~65 MB initial and growing).
# Per-ticker parquets served from Cloudflare R2 via scripts/publish_r2 --dirs hk_stocks_ext.
# Committed files in the same dir (_universe.json, _checkpoint.json) are NOT ignored.
data/hk_stocks_ext/*.parquet

# SLF-048 Wikipedia attention pageview store (R2-only since 2026-07-06).
# Deep history 2015-07→ (~30 MB, rewrites whole per-ticker parquets daily — repo
# bloat if tracked). Nightly loop: fetch_r2 restore -> wiki_pageviews upsert ->
# publish_r2 --dirs attention. Recover locally: python -m scripts.fetch_r2 --dirs attention
data/attention/*.parquet

# Massive.com whole-market daily OHLCV derived store (R2-only; Setup-Species §7 W0.6a).
# Per-ticker parquets published via scripts/publish_r2 --dirs massive_stock_day.
# Committed: data/massive_stock_day/_manifest.json (freshness anchor for audit_r2)
#            data/massive_stock_day/_backfill_state.json (resume state)
# ~12,400 tickers × ~350 rows = ~240 MB total — must NOT be committed to git.
data/massive_stock_day/*.parquet
# Options Alpha §A4/A8: raw Massive.com options day-agg cache.
# Local cache + R2-published via publish_r2 --dirs massive_options_day.
# NEVER committed to git; content is re-downloadable from massive.com entitlement.
# See research/OPTIONS_ALPHA_MASTERPLAN.md §3 rulings A4 and A8.
data/massive_options_day/
# ThetaData Phase-A T1 backfill store (rulings A4/A8 + §7.2 of LIVE_ORDER_FLOW_BRAINSTORM).
# ~30–80 GB raw EOD chains + OI + Greeks; published to R2 via publish_r2 --dirs thetadata_eod.
# NEVER committed to git; re-downloadable from ThetaData entitlement.
# Committed (git-tracked): _backfill_state.json (resume state) + _manifest.json (R2 anchor).
data/thetadata_eod/eod/
data/thetadata_eod/oi/
data/thetadata_eod/greeks/
# Negation: keep the committed state + manifest files tracked even though the data subdirs above are excluded
!data/thetadata_eod/_backfill_state.json
!data/thetadata_eod/_manifest.json
# (NOT R2) — not regenerable without re-scraping; critical H2a phase-0 evidence.
# data/hk_shorts/ is intentionally NOT listed here; all files are committed.
# ---- Slice G store decisions (2026-07-03) ------------------------------------
# CIRO short-position panel: data/ciro_short/ is GIT-tracked (not R2).
# ~114 report-dates x ~2,500 TSX rows = ~285k rows = ~14MB -- inside git threshold.
# positions.parquet and coverage.json are intentionally committed so the CSPR
# history (2021-10->) accrues in the repo. data/ciro_short/ is NOT gitignored.
#
# Canada insider -- new append-only store vs legacy blob:
#   data/canada_insider/transactions.parquet -- GIT-tracked (new; accumulates history)
#   data/canada_insider/insider.parquet      -- GIT-tracked (legacy; kept 1 month for
#                                              migration safety, phase out 2026-08-03)
# Both are small (<5MB), non-regenerable, git-tracked. Not gitignored.

# ThetaData T2a signed-flow features: data/tape_flow/daily/ is GIT-tracked (NOT R2).
# Storage math: ~400 roots × 252 sessions/yr × 3y × ~80 bytes/row (parquet compressed)
# ≈ 24 MB total — well under the ~30 MB git threshold.
# Per-name parquets are append-only feature stores (aggregate-then-discard; no raw rows).
# Revisit if universe exceeds 800 names or backfill extends to 12y (would reach ~193 MB → R2).
# data/tape_flow/daily/ is intentionally NOT gitignored; all per-root parquets are committed.
#
# data/tape_flow/raw/ contains FULL tape bytes (ETF anchors + episode windows) — R2-plane only.
# Only the manifest (_manifest.json) is committed; raw parquets are NEVER committed.
data/tape_flow/raw/*.parquet
# state file is tiny/git-tracked (resumable backfill):
!data/tape_flow/_state.json
!data/tape_flow/raw/_manifest.json

# ObsidianBrain vault (own git repo; view over memory/ + research/, lives inside this folder)
ObsidianBrain/

